    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "CF43F7E49FD29367",
      "text": "你看到赛吉我\\n很厉害的一面了吧？\\c\\nNext，你要让我看看\\n你的厉害之处啊～！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
