    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "B015FFB72F24CA0E",
      "text": "学院的学生\\n把我称为赛吉兄，\\r\\n有“吉”又有“凶”，到底是哪个意思呀～？[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
