      "hash64": "B015FEB72F24C85B",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]\\n是超级very very好的孩子！\\r\\n或许它有点像[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你～！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
